{%- comment -%}
  Country-specific Shipping accordion. Picks the shopper's market from
  Shopify Markets (localization.country.iso_code) and shows only that
  market's delivery time and rates, so a shopper in London never reads
  about Brisbane-to-Sydney times.

  Rates and thresholds come from guillo-shipping-rates, shared with product
  schema. The values are the existing published policy, not an independent
  verification of current checkout configuration. No new rates are claimed.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign ship_cc = localization.country.iso_code | default: 'ZZ'
  capture ship_values
    render 'guillo-shipping-rates', country_code: ship_cc
  endcapture
  assign ship_values = ship_values | strip | split: '|'
  assign ship_zone = ship_values[8] | default: 'other'
-%}
<p>In-stock orders placed by 3pm AEST are dispatched from Brisbane the same day, Monday–Friday. Pre-orders follow the dispatch timing on the product page.</p>
{%- case ship_zone -%}
  {%- when 'au' -%}
    <ul>
      <li>Delivery across Australia in {{ ship_values[3] }} to {{ ship_values[4] }} days.</li>
      <li>Standard ${{ ship_values[1] }}, free on orders over ${{ ship_values[2] }}.</li>
      <li>Express ${{ ship_values[5] }}, free on orders over ${{ ship_values[6] }}.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Tracked door to door on every order.</p>
  {%- when 'nz' -%}
    <ul>
      <li>Delivery to New Zealand in {{ ship_values[3] }} to {{ ship_values[4] }} days.</li>
      <li>Standard NZ${{ ship_values[1] }}.</li>
      <li>Priority express free on orders over NZ${{ ship_values[6] }}.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Tracked door to door on every order.</p>
  {%- when 'sg' -%}
    <ul>
      <li>Delivery to Singapore in {{ ship_values[3] }} to {{ ship_values[4] }} days.</li>
      <li>Standard S${{ ship_values[1] }}, free on orders over S${{ ship_values[2] }}.</li>
      <li>Express S${{ ship_values[5] }}, free on orders over S${{ ship_values[6] }}.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Ships DDP. Duties and taxes are paid at checkout, so nothing is owed on arrival.</p>
  {%- when 'gb' -%}
    <ul>
      <li>Delivery to the United Kingdom in {{ ship_values[3] }} to {{ ship_values[4] }} days.</li>
      <li>Standard £{{ ship_values[1] }}, free on orders over £{{ ship_values[2] }}.</li>
      <li>Express £{{ ship_values[5] }}, free on orders over £{{ ship_values[6] }}.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Ships DDP. Duties and taxes are paid at checkout, so nothing is owed on arrival.</p>
  {%- when 'eu' -%}
    <ul>
      <li>Delivery across Europe in {{ ship_values[3] }} to {{ ship_values[4] }} days.</li>
      <li>Standard €{{ ship_values[1] }}.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Ships DDP. Duties and taxes are paid at checkout, so nothing is owed on arrival.</p>
  {%- when 'us' -%}
    <ul>
      <li>Standard US${{ ship_values[1] }}.</li>
      <li>Express US${{ ship_values[5] }}.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Ships DDP. Duties and taxes are paid at checkout, so nothing is owed on arrival.</p>
  {%- else -%}
    <p>Shipping options and cost for your country are shown at checkout.</p>
    <p>Ships DDP. Duties and taxes are paid at checkout, so nothing is owed on arrival.</p>
{%- endcase -%}
